EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for speaking with me regarding the succession of the donor-advised fund account for {!Case.Deceased_Donor__c}.

As discussed, the next step is to complete the Succession Recommendation Form to indicate your preferred pathway for the account assets. This form will help us process your request efficiently.

Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
Form Sent Date: {!Case.Form_Sent_Date__c}

You have three pathway options:
1. **Final Grant** - Liquidate the account and issue a grant to qualified charities
2. **New DAF Account** - Transfer assets to a new donor-advised fund in your name
3. **Disclaim Assets** - Decline the account according to fund bylaws

Please complete the form at your earliest convenience. If you have any questions about the pathways or need assistance completing the form, please don't hesitate to reach out.

You can access the form here: [Link will be provided separately]

Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.

Best regards,

{!User.Name}
{!User.Title}
{!Organization.Name}
{!User.Phone}
{!User.Email}
